                                <div class="actu-text">Arval, a major player in long-term vehicle leasing and a specialist in mobility solutions, has completed the acquisition of Athlon, formerly a subsidiary of Mercedes-Benz Group, in line with the announced timetable. This transaction enables Arval to reach a combined fleet of 2.3 million vehicles, cr... - (source: group.bnpparibas)</div>
